---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: Call or message Milena at Onyx World Travel about an upcoming trip or a custom trip idea.
---
{%- from "macros.njk" import icon with context -%}

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Get in touch</h1>
    <p class="lead">Questions about a trip, or an idea for one? I'd love to hear from you.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card contact-card">
        <h2 class="h3">Call me</h2>
        {%- if site.phone %}
        <a class="big-link" href="{{ site.phone | telHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>
        {%- else %}
        <p class="big-link">{% ph "Phone number" %}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <p>The easiest way to reach me. {% if site.replyTime %}I usually get back to people {{ site.replyTime }}.{% else %}{% ph "How quickly Milena usually gets back to people" %}{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card contact-card">
        <h2 class="h3">Email me</h2>
        {%- if site.email %}
        <a class="big-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
        {%- else %}
        <p class="big-link">{% ph "Email address" %}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <p>Based in {{ site.region }}. Happy to meet in person if you're local.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-white" aria-labelledby="message-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card form-card">
      <h2 id="message-heading" class="h3">Send me a message</h2>
      {% include "partials/contact-form.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
